From 984b2af6c2198104e9ed2856793f9140d85299ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tbrasselle <tbrasselle@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:52:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ui): report door with prefilled GitHub issue and
 clipboard screenshot

The status strip gains a Report door beside the Debug info door. It
opens a window with a title field, two kind buttons that open the
browser on a prefilled GitHub new-issue URL (title, body and the bug /
enhancement label filled in), and a Copy screenshot button that puts a
CPU-raster picture of the document on the clipboard. The body embeds
the Debug info report (#157).

The repository gains a blank issue template and a config.yml enabling
blank issues: GitHub's prefill query applies only to a blank template.
The act-report glyph is an original SVG master.

Pinned by report_tests (7), the shell_structure and
tree_rows_badges_and_actions_are_svg_mastered structural pins.

Fixes #1696
