 crates/ui/src/egui_app/report_tests.rs |  10 +++
 crates/ui/src/interact.rs              |  10 ++-
 docs/decisions/1696-report-button.md   |  24 ++++++
 5 files changed, 226 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

